9,Search for data in: Omotic etymology,https://starlingdb.org/cgi-bin/query.cgi?basename=\data\semham\omoet&scriptname=main&root=config,"Proto-Omotic Afroasiatic etymology Meaning Ometo Wolamo (Wolaitta) Gamo (Gemu) Gofa Dawro (Kullo) Malo (Melo) Zala Basketo (Mesketo) Male Dache Dorze Oyda Zaysse Zergulla Koyra (Badditu, Amuru) Gidicho Haruro (Kachama) Ganjule Janjero (Yamma, Yemsa) Kafa (Kaficho)...",Kachama-Ganjule,Afro-Asiatic
